---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Brand & design guidelines | Shellui
description: Shellui design guidelines, brand assets, and logos. Download official logos in SVG and PNG, and learn about our visual language and design principles.
---

<article class="page-top px-4 pb-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    {% include "breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">Brand & design guidelines</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Visual identity, design principles, and brand assets for Shellui. Use these guidelines when creating content, building integrations, or talking about Shellui.
    </p>

    <!-- Design Principles -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Design principles</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Shellui is a <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">shell</strong> — a calm outer container that holds chrome (navigation, authentication, administration, storage) so that applications running inside can focus on their domain. These principles guide all Shellui brand and product work.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Frame over flourish</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            The outer shell should feel like containment, not decoration. Prefer structural elements (borders, rails, clear boundaries) over decorative gradients. Let the product speak for itself.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Scarce honey gold</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Use gold sparingly as an accent — it signals "the shell is attending" (active nav, focus states, CTAs). Too much gold becomes noise.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Seams visible</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Don't hide the edges. Show configuration files, demo code, architectural diagrams. Developers trust systems they can see into.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Interior is proof</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            The best marketing for Shellui is Shellui itself. All surfaces (docs, playground, admin) run inside the shell. Dogfood the product everywhere.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Color -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Color</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Shellui uses a minimal color palette anchored by honey gold and neutral grays. Gold is an accent, not a flood.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Primary (honey gold)</h3>
        <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
            <div class="h-24" style="background-color: #e3a512;"></div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Primary (light)</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">#e3a512</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">--color-primary</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
            <div class="h-24" style="background-color: #e8b84a;"></div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Primary (dark)</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">#e8b84a</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">--color-primary</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
            <div class="h-24" style="background-color: #c4920a;"></div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Primary ink</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">#c4920a</p>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">--color-primary-ink</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Use <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">text-primary-ink</code> in light mode for links and emphasis; use <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">text-primary</code> in dark mode.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Neutrals</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Shellui uses Tailwind's default gray scale (gray-50 through gray-950) for backgrounds, text, and borders. Let the grays be calm and recede; let gold draw attention when it matters.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Typography -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Typography</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Shellui uses the system font stack for speed and familiarity. Type hierarchy creates rhythm through size and spacing, not heavy weights.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <p class="text-4xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Display heading</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">text-4xl, font-semibold</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Section heading</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">text-2xl, font-semibold</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Body text with comfortable line-height for readability</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">text-base, font-normal</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">UI label text</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">text-sm, font-medium</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Voice -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Voice and tone</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Shellui's voice is direct, confident without boasting, and technical without unnecessary jargon.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 p-6 dark:border-emerald-900/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:bg-emerald-500">
              <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-100">Good</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200">
                "Shellui is a microfrontend shell that wraps your application with shared navigation, authentication, storage, and administration. Build the product. We'll handle the chrome."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6 dark:border-red-900/50 dark:bg-red-950/20">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-600 text-white dark:bg-red-500">
              <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-900 dark:text-red-100">Avoid</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-red-800 dark:text-red-200">
                "Shellui is the next-generation platform revolutionizing how teams build web applications."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Preferred language</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li><strong class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Shell</strong> — the outer container</li>
          <li><strong class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Chrome</strong> — the shared UI (nav, auth, admin, storage)</li>
          <li><strong class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Apps</strong> — the things developers build that live inside the shell</li>
          <li><strong class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Foundation</strong> — what Shellui provides</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Logo Usage -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Logo usage</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        The Shellui logo is available as an icon mark (square) and full wordmark. Keep clear space around all sides equal to at least the height of the mark.
      </p>
      
      <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 p-6 dark:border-emerald-900/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white dark:bg-emerald-500">
              <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-100">Do</p>
              <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200">
                <li>• Use the provided SVG or PNG files</li>
                <li>• Maintain clear space around the logo</li>
                <li>• Use transparent variants on colored backgrounds</li>
                <li>• Scale proportionally</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6 dark:border-red-900/50 dark:bg-red-950/20">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-600 text-white dark:bg-red-500">
              <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-900 dark:text-red-100">Don't</p>
              <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-red-800 dark:text-red-200">
                <li>• Stretch, skew, or rotate the logo</li>
                <li>• Recolor the logo</li>
                <li>• Add effects (shadows, outlines, glows)</li>
                <li>• Use on low-contrast backgrounds</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Downloads -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Logo downloads</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Download official Shellui logos for articles, talks, integrations, and partner pages. No permission needed for editorial or community use.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">About Shellui</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Shellui is an open-source microfrontend shell that wraps your application with shared navigation, authentication, storage, and administration.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li>Prefer SVG when possible; use PNG for contexts that do not support vector graphics.</li>
          <li>Use the transparent variants on colored or photographic backgrounds.</li>
          <li>Maintain clear space and avoid stretching or recoloring.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% for group in brandAssets %}
      <section class="mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ group.name }}</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {% for asset in group.items %}
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
              {# One shared theme-aware checkerboard for every tile (light + dark mode). #}
              <div class="flex aspect-[16/10] items-center justify-center p-8 bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#f3f4f6_25%,transparent_25%,transparent_75%,#f3f4f6_75%,#f3f4f6),linear-gradient(45deg,#f3f4f6_25%,transparent_25%,transparent_75%,#f3f4f6_75%,#f3f4f6)] bg-[length:16px_16px] bg-[position:0_0,8px_8px] dark:bg-[linear-gradient(45deg,#1f2937_25%,transparent_25%,transparent_75%,#1f2937_75%,#1f2937),linear-gradient(45deg,#1f2937_25%,transparent_25%,transparent_75%,#1f2937_75%,#1f2937)] dark:bg-[length:16px_16px] dark:bg-[position:0_0,8px_8px]">
                <img src="{{ asset.previewHref }}" alt="{{ asset.label }}" class="max-h-24 max-w-full object-contain" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="border-t border-gray-200 px-4 py-4 dark:border-gray-800">
                <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ asset.label }}</p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                  {% for f in asset.formats %}{{ f.ext }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}
                </p>
                <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
                  {% for f in asset.formats %}
                    <a
                      href="{{ f.href }}"
                      download="{{ f.file }}"
                      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink hover:opacity-90 dark:text-primary"
                    >
                      Download {{ f.ext }}
                      <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span>
                    </a>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endfor %}

    <p class="mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      Questions about brand usage? <a href="/company/contact/" class="text-primary-ink underline hover:opacity-90 dark:text-primary">Get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</article>
